    just send-mission missions/Octagon/Lime-mission.json Lime
    just send-mission missions/Octagon/Aqua-mission.json Aqua
    just send-mission missions/Octagon/Fuchsia-mission.json Fuchsia
    just send-mission missions/Octagon/DodgerBlue-mission.json DodgerBlue
    just send-mission missions/Octagon/Gold-mission.json Gold
    just send-mission missions/Octagon/Orange-mission.json Orange
